---
layout: base.njk
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#- Old address of a page that moved (front matter: title, permalink, redirect_to). head.njk sends the
    browser on to redirect_to at once and gives search engines its canonical link and noindex; the body
    is for a browser that does not follow the refresh. Out of the sitemap. -#}
<div class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
        <h1 class="page-title" id="page-title">{{ heading }}</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<section class="section section-flush-top" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <p>This page has moved to <a href="{{ redirect_to }}">{{ redirect_to | canonical(site.url) }}</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>
